# Voice Pipeline

```
STT (mobile: expo-speech-recognition)
  → prepareMoveTranscript
  → normalizeMove / resolveMove (chess-core)
  → Apply | Disambiguation
```

## Rules

- On-device STT primary (`requiresOnDeviceRecognition` when supported)
- `normalizeMove` is a pure, table-tested function in chess-core
- Disambiguation responses re-enter the **same** pipeline — no shortcut
- Stockfish WASM off main thread

## Homophones

night→N, rook→R, bishop→B, queen→Q, king→K (handled in `chess-core` `match-move.ts`)

## Mobile wiring

`useMatchSpeech` → `submitPlayerMove` in `useMatchSession`. See `voice-match` skill.
